  Name: E7 Postcard
  Text: "Dear Hr\xF6nn,\r\nHope you are well!\r\nI\u2019m currently in Portmancy.
    Where any wizard who knows anything is, or at least that's what they tell me.
    It's a bit uppity here to be honest with you, but they sure have a lot of libraries!
    \r\n\r\nI will write to you again soon,\r\nTerra"
